<!--
  The AppStream description a software centre shows. The component id is the
  file name of the desktop entry without .desktop, and it has to stay that way:
  <launchable> below binds the two, and only through that binding does the
  centre know which entry its "Start" button runs.

  The id is io.github.hnsstrk.denkzettel since the customer's decision of
  28.08.2026 (issue #109). Reverse-DNS naming asks for a domain the project
  controls and denkzettel.org is not one, so the io.github.<user>.<app> form of
  a project hosted on GitHub applies. It is all lowercase, which is what
  appstreamcli asks for at its pedantic level. Changing it again is not free:
  the id is the file name of the desktop entry and of the autostart entry, so
  installing writes both beside the old ones instead of replacing them — until
  someone deletes the old ones the session starts the daemon twice and the
  capture window pops up at every login (SPEC 2.4).

  The D-Bus service carries the same id since 29.08.2026 (issue #112):
  appidentity.cpp sets hnsstrk.github.io as organizationDomain, and
  KDBusService reverses it and appends the application name, which gives
  io.github.hnsstrk.denkzettel (SPEC 2.3, 2.4). denkzettel.org has left the
  code with it.

  Every text exists twice, English unmarked and German as xml:lang="de" — the
  user's decision of 2026-08-04. AppStream reads unmarked text as English, so
  the unmarked German the desktop entry could afford here would show German
  wording to every English-speaking user. The price is deliberate: every later
  change to a line of text is two changes.

  The screenshots come from the repository as raw URLs, also decided on
  2026-08-04. That binds this file to the branch name main and makes the
  repository a permanent image host: whoever renames the branch or moves the
  images breaks the pictures in every software centre, and no test notices.

  What is described here is what the program does today. The specification
  describes considerably more — voice notes, AI analysis, suggestions, export;
  none of it is built, so none of it stands here.
-->
<component type="desktop-application">
  <id>io.github.hnsstrk.denkzettel</id>

  <metadata_license>MIT</metadata_license>
  <project_license>MIT</project_license>

  <name>Denkzettel</name>
  <summary>Capture thoughts quickly and sort them later</summary>
  <summary xml:lang="de">Gedanken schnell festhalten und später ordnen</summary>

  <description>
    <p>
      Denkzettel is a quick-capture scratchpad for KDE Plasma. Press the global
      shortcut, type, press Ctrl+Enter — the note is stored and the window is
      gone. No file name, no save dialog, no question where to put it.
    </p>
    <p xml:lang="de">
      Denkzettel ist ein Notizzettel zum schnellen Festhalten für KDE Plasma.
      Tastenkürzel drücken, tippen, Strg+Enter — die Notiz ist gespeichert und
      das Fenster wieder weg. Kein Dateiname, kein Speichern-Dialog, keine Frage,
      wohin damit.
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Capture with one key press, without a file name and without a dialog</li>
      <li xml:lang="de">Erfassen mit einem Tastendruck, ohne Dateinamen und ohne Dialog</li>
      <li>A library of all notes, grouped by day like an inbox: today, yesterday, this week, last week, older</li>
      <li xml:lang="de">Eine Bibliothek aller Notizen, nach Tagen gruppiert wie ein Posteingang: heute, gestern, diese Woche, letzte Woche, älter</li>
      <li>Full-text search that matches inside words and folds diacritics</li>
      <li xml:lang="de">Volltextsuche, die auch mitten im Wort trifft und Umlaute verzeiht</li>
      <li>Editing notes, and deleting them with five seconds of undo</li>
      <li xml:lang="de">Notizen bearbeiten, und löschen mit fünf Sekunden zum Rückgängigmachen</li>
      <li>Runs in the background, sits in the system tray, starts with the session</li>
      <li xml:lang="de">Läuft im Hintergrund, sitzt im Systemabschnitt der Kontrollleiste, startet mit der Sitzung</li>
      <li>Everything stays local in one SQLite file — nothing leaves the machine</li>
      <li xml:lang="de">Alles bleibt lokal in einer SQLite-Datei — nichts verlässt den Rechner</li>
    </ul>
  </description>

  <launchable type="desktop-id">io.github.hnsstrk.denkzettel.desktop</launchable>

  <categories>
    <category>Utility</category>
  </categories>

  <developer id="io.github.hnsstrk">
    <name>hnsstrk</name>
  </developer>

  <url type="homepage">https://github.com/hnsstrk/denkzettel</url>
  <url type="bugtracker">https://github.com/hnsstrk/denkzettel/issues</url>

  <screenshots>
    <screenshot type="default">
      <caption>The capture window with a half-written note</caption>
      <caption xml:lang="de">Das Erfassungsfenster mit einer halb geschriebenen Notiz</caption>
      <image>https://raw.githubusercontent.com/hnsstrk/denkzettel/main/docs/images/erfassungsfenster.png</image>
      <image xml:lang="de">https://raw.githubusercontent.com/hnsstrk/denkzettel/main/docs/images/de/erfassungsfenster.png</image>
    </screenshot>
    <screenshot>
      <caption>The library: the note list grouped by day, beside it the reading pane</caption>
      <caption xml:lang="de">Die Bibliothek: die nach Tagen gruppierte Notizliste, daneben die Leseansicht</caption>
      <image>https://raw.githubusercontent.com/hnsstrk/denkzettel/main/docs/images/bibliothek.png</image>
      <image xml:lang="de">https://raw.githubusercontent.com/hnsstrk/denkzettel/main/docs/images/de/bibliothek.png</image>
    </screenshot>
  </screenshots>

  <translation type="gettext">denkzettel</translation>

  <content_rating type="oars-1.1"/>

  <!--
